<title>USA: Bank of Granite sees Q4, 96 record levels.</title>
<headline>Bank of Granite sees Q4, 96 record levels.</headline>
<dateline>GRANITE FALLS, N.C. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Granite Corp said Tuesday it expects fourth quarter and 1996 earnings to be at &quot;record levels.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said in a release Tuesday that results will be available around January 13, 1997.</p>
</text>
